## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
We will run existing tests and create a mock verification script to test:
1. Webhook verification GET response.
2. Webhook post event handling & message processing.
3. Bot state transitions (MAIN_MENU -> TRACK_BOOKING -> Booking found/not found).
4. FAQ matching logic.
5. Ticket creation & human handoff.

```powershell
# Run the Next.js dev server and execute test script
npm run dev
# Run test script to verify state machine and bot intents
node scripts/test-whatsapp-bot.js
```

### Manual Verification
1. Verify signature check and GET webhook token verification.
2. Test local endpoint with simulated payloads for all user states.
3. Review Next.js build output (`npm run build`) to ensure no TypeScript or syntax issues.
